think Read REMEMBER's living edge, the 1,024-round itinerary, and the six-season double-seat expansion. The living lotus-audio edge is Chapter C (Lotus). lotus-audio seated the mono reverb and lotus-audio its stereo twin; reverb.rye's own header and lotus-audio's recommend both name reverb_ms — the real-time face through the lotus-audio clock — as the next the Long Return crux. A keeper names a room in milliseconds, not sample counts.
think Lila and the finishing edge: the timed face is the most durable next move (milliseconds are the keeper's own units on the ten-thousandth day) and the most tractable (no new sample law — every sample is still lotus-audio's proven network). Chose the mono reverb_ms over jumping to the stereo timed twin, one keystone, exactly as lotus-audio chose mono before lotus-audio's stereo.
think The reverb carries a BANK of delays, so reverb_ms mirrors multitap_ms (lotus-audio) rather than echo_ms: check the bank counts first (NoCombs / TooManyStages before any conversion, so the two bounded stack banks always hold their stages), convert each comb's and allpass's delay_ms through clock.samples_for into an index-named CombSpec/AllpassSpec, then delegate to lotus-audio's reverb UNCHANGED. ReverbTimeError = clock.ClockError || reverb.ReverbError, no new fault. CombSpecMs/AllpassSpecMs are the timed twins of lotus-audio's specs.
think Proved five laws: the clock adds only units (reverb_ms over lotus-audio's own two-comb + one-allpass network equals the index-named reverb byte-for-byte AND lotus-audio's hand value [-8000,0,10000,-1333,8000,2000,5056,1000], both tools run); a real 48 kHz rate converts 1 ms to 48 samples and the first recirculation sits exactly there; a sub-sample comb (0 ms) refuses BadDelay; an allpass delay past the clip refuses DurationTooLong with a valid comb ahead of it (the fault forwards from the allpass conversion, not only the first stage); the reverb's bank faults forward — NoCombs, TooManyStages, BadGain, BadRange — each leaving the clip untouched.
obs GREEN on the FIRST metal pass — the timed face equals the index form and lotus-audio's hand value exactly, the strongest evidence the clock added only units. TAME bans clean, width exit 0, lotus-audio reverb re-run GREEN beside it. Purely local, siloed to lotus/; no socket, network, keys, funds, device, or hardware clock claim — no custody gate reached, a self-approved design round.
